  "content_description": "",
  "content_text_body": "The goal is to clearly define expectations and priorities for your team and provide them with responsibilities that make the best use of their strengths and abilities.\n\n[Clarifying Performance Expectations](video \"LiL3_Clarifying_Expectations\")\n\n**Watch**: *Clarifying Performance Expectations*\n\n---\n\nDuring times of stress, it's particularly important for team members to understand what impact is in their control and the best way to focus their skills and energy to be successful.\n\nThink about how you lead your team and answer these questions: \n\n* *Are you crystal clear on each team member's role? Are they?*\n\n* *Are team members clear about how to best prioritize their time to best leverage their strengths?*\n\n* *What percent of each workday does each team member spend utilizing their strengths?*\n\n* *Do team members understand what is in their control to work on right now?*\n\nConsidering your answers, where could you do a better job managing roles on your team?",
